<b>יב.</b> "Incense." Since after the daily offering they offered incense (Beit Yosef). Hagahot Maimoniot has saying incense before the daily offering based on Yoma (morning incense between blood and limbs), but Seder Hayom says daily offering first because principal atonement is in the blood; similarly Rabbeinu Yonah regarding Minchah time beginning from shechitat tamid. For Minchah everyone agrees tamid precedes incense (Yoma). The view placing Minchah before incense is not precise.
